The files under sf/src/Sf/Lf/ are a port to Stitchwort of chapters of
Software Foundations, Volume 1: Logical Foundations, by Benjamin C. Pierce
et al. (Author of Record for the volume: Benjamin C. Pierce), from the
release sources at https://softwarefoundations.cis.upenn.edu/ (lf.tgz,
files dated 2026-08-24). The book's explanations are kept as comments,
shortened and adapted; its definitions and proofs are translated. They are
used under the book's licence, reproduced below exactly as it appears in
the LICENSE file of that release.

The book's authors ask that solutions to its exercises not be posted
publicly. This port states each exercise and leaves it unsolved.

